# The check graph writes its content-addressed evidence cache under this
# directory (checks/p101-check-graph.py). Everything here is a local cache of
# check logs and receipts, never a tracked input, and the graph already treats
# this directory as non-source.
#
# The ignore lives here rather than in the repository .gitignore because that
# file is distributed byte-for-byte from templates/template-c by
# distribution/copy-scripts.sh, and only the scripts repository has a target/.
*
!.gitignore
